message: Cite the tagged software release and its exact source revision.
title: "NUIF: Neutral User Interface Format research project"
type: software
version: 0.1.0-alpha.3
date-released: 2026-08-30
authors:
  - name: Refpath contributors
    website: https://github.com/refpath/nuif/graphs/contributors
abstract: >-
  NUIF is a pre-standard research project for authored interface interchange,
  retentive synchronization, explicit fidelity reporting and executable
  conformance experiments. The cited alpha release includes a reference core,
  bounded adapter profiles, conformance fixtures and a native research editor.
keywords:
  - user interface
  - interchange format
  - design tools
  - retentive synchronization
  - conformance testing
license:
